{"id":"c02","stage":0,"title":"你从哪里来","scene":"和同学互相介绍自己的国家。","roles":["敏智","你"],"lines":[{"id":"c02-1","ko":"어느 나라 사람이에요?","zh":"你是哪国人？","note":"어느 用来询问“哪一个”。","words":[{"term":"어느","zh":"哪一个","id":"76e7139b030308e7","audio":"/audio/76e7139b030308e75b1c.mp3"},{"term":"나라","zh":"国家","id":"02faec8ed1c75703","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3"},{"term":"사람","zh":"人","id":"389e7564ae2551b4","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/2732c68ab40f1d43e7d1.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"어느","meaning":"哪一个","explanation":"어느修饰后面的名词，用于询问选择。","readings":[{"term":"어느","audio":"/audio/76e7139b030308e75b1c.mp3"}]},{"text":"나라","meaning":"国家","explanation":"나라是名词；어느 나라意为“哪个国家”。","readings":[{"term":"어느","audio":"/audio/76e7139b030308e75b1c.mp3"},{"term":"나라","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3"}]},{"text":"사람이에요?","meaning":"的人？","explanation":"사람（人）+ 이에요（是，礼貌体）；나라 사람合起来询问国籍。","readings":[{"term":"나라","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3"},{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c02-2","ko":"저는 중국 사람이에요.","zh":"我是中国人。","note":"国籍可以用“国家名 + 사람”表达。","words":[{"term":"중국","zh":"中国","id":"3b31f8d5a1176ab7","audio":"/audio/3b31f8d5a1176ab76f9c.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/2b88a9b6c4bc69d538aa.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저（我，谦称）+ 는（提示话题）。","readings":[{"term":"저는","audio":"/audio/0b05af6c0b14d6e70820.mp3"}]},{"text":"중국","meaning":"中国","explanation":"중국修饰사람，表示国籍。","readings":[{"term":"중국","audio":"/audio/3b31f8d5a1176ab76f9c.mp3"}]},{"text":"사람이에요.","meaning":"是……人","explanation":"사람（人）+ 이에요（是）；중국 사람意为“中国人”。","readings":[{"term":"중국","audio":"/audio/3b31f8d5a1176ab76f9c.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c02-3","ko":"한국어를 공부해요?","zh":"你在学韩语吗？","note":"同一句式加问号、用上扬语调，可以提问。","words":[{"term":"한국어","zh":"韩语","id":"ea3252281bc3bcec","audio":"/audio/ea3252281bc3bcec5672.mp3"},{"term":"공부하다","zh":"学习","id":"002a60f979d8c3de","audio":"/audio/002a60f979d8c3de292f.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/8b83a24c3ab15f81c006.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"한국어를","meaning":"韩语","explanation":"한국어（韩语）+ 를（宾格助词，表示学习的对象）。","readings":[{"term":"한국어","audio":"/audio/ea3252281bc3bcec5672.mp3"}]},{"text":"공부해요?","meaning":"在学习吗？","explanation":"공부하다（学习）→ 공부해요（礼貌体）；句末上扬可用于提问。","readings":[{"term":"공부하다","audio":"/audio/002a60f979d8c3de292f.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c02-4","ko":"네, 한국어를 배워요.","zh":"是的，我在学韩语。","note":"배우다 强调学习、学会某种知识或技能。","words":[{"term":"네","zh":"是","id":"1c0ddfd005093840","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"},{"term":"배우다","zh":"学习","id":"2c65351237177855","audio":"/audio/2c65351237177855703f.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/5f24e547321fe59ca49d.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是的","explanation":"네表示肯定回答。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}]},{"text":"한국어를","meaning":"韩语","explanation":"한국어（韩语）+ 를（宾格助词）。","readings":[{"term":"한국어를","audio":"/audio/5ceaa932f63f4a694c6f.mp3"}]},{"text":"배워요.","meaning":"在学习","explanation":"배우다（学、学会）→ 배워요，우与어요结合为워요。","readings":[{"term":"배우다","audio":"/audio/2c65351237177855703f.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c02-5","ko":"한국에 언제 왔어요?","zh":"你什么时候来韩国的？","note":"왔어요 是 오다 的过去式。","words":[{"term":"한국","zh":"韩国","id":"1eb7da6d56d883ca","audio":"/audio/1eb7da6d56d883ca1dd1.mp3"},{"term":"언제","zh":"什么时候","id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"},{"term":"오다","zh":"来","id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/d6c631c8e8b48f4e7b56.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"한국에","meaning":"到韩国","explanation":"한국（韩国）+ 에（到达的地点）。","readings":[{"term":"한국","audio":"/audio/1eb7da6d56d883ca1dd1.mp3"}]},{"text":"언제","meaning":"什么时候","explanation":"언제用于询问时间。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}]},{"text":"왔어요?","meaning":"来的？","explanation":"오다（来）+ 过去时-았- + 礼貌语尾-어요 → 왔어요。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c02-6","ko":"지난주에 왔어요.","zh":"我上周来的。","note":"过去已经发生的动作，用过去时。","words":[{"term":"지난주","zh":"上周","id":"7d3f1e161caf0a72","audio":"/audio/7d3f1e161caf0a7205ae.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/830db5c6d48c8f540cb4.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"지난주에","meaning":"上周","explanation":"지난주（上周）+ 에（标示时间）。","readings":[{"term":"지난주","audio":"/audio/7d3f1e161caf0a7205ae.mp3"}]},{"text":"왔어요.","meaning":"来的","explanation":"오다（来）的过去礼貌形式；主语和目的地根据上文省略。","readings":[{"term":"왔어요","audio":"/audio/2ef5daa5f516291289bc.mp3"}]}]}],"day":6,"sequenceScore":0.8934,"questions":[{"lineIndex":2,"options":["你在学韩语吗？","你是哪国人？","我是中国人。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":4,"options":["你是哪国人？","你什么时候来韩国的？","我是中国人。"],"answer":1}]}
